		(at 126.25 111.6425 180)
		(descr "Vishay VSMB2943SL side-looking IR emitter, 2.3x2.55x2.3mm with a 1.8mm dome lens. Pads per the datasheet's IPC-7351 solder pad proposal: 0.9 x 1.2 mm on a 4.2 mm span. Doc 83479 rev 1.2. Pin 1 = cathode, pin 2 = anode. THE BEAM FIRES TOWARD +Y, in the board plane, with its axis 1.15 mm above the board — see the F.Fab arrow. Beam direction and polarity are rigidly linked: a 180 deg rotation flips both.")
