		(layer "F.Cu")
		(uuid "e0b6f930-e70c-4c50-887f-0996f991e08a")
		(at 83 122.5 90)
		(descr "Raspberry Pi Radio Module 2 (RMC20452T), 21 castellated pads, 14.5 x 16.5 x 2.55 mm. Pads 2.0 x 1.0 mm, 1.5 mm pitch, 0.5 mm outboard of the module outline; side columns 1.8 mm from the bottom edge, bottom row 2.75 mm from the left edge. Geometry from datasheet RP-008943-DS rev 7 figure 6. Pin 1 top left, counter-clockwise. The antenna is the top edge: the RF keepout on Dwgs.User is 35.5 x 18.5 mm and must be free of metal on ALL layers, so put the top edge on the board edge and most of it falls off the board.")
